# DPI-H Lab authors

DPI-H Lab was developed as a follow-up to the Asia-Pacific Digital Health Interoperability
Bootcamp (Sydney, 2026), supported by the Strengthening Standards Capability Project (SSCP).

Authors:

- Umer Nisar (CSIRO SSCP), lead author
- Rumanusina Maua (SPC)
- Jordi Piera Jimenez

"The DPI-H Lab authors" in copyright notices means the people listed above, together with
contributors whose contributions are accepted into this repository (see the git history).
